{"id":637,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"キリスト教と探究で自立を育む教育","feature_description":"キリスト教と探究で自立を育む教育を教育の中心に据え、教科の学びと学校生活を結び付けながら、生徒が自ら考え行動する力を育てます。基礎となる知識や技能を着実に身に付けるとともに、探究、対話、行事、部活動などの経験を通して、多様な仲間と協働し課題に向き合います。一人ひとりが目標を見つけ、学びを深め、社会や世界に関わる視野を広げられるよう支える教育です。","clubs":[{"id":11758,"name":"体操","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohama-eiwa.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11759,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohama-eiwa.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11760,"name":"ソフトボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohama-eiwa.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11761,"name":"ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohama-eiwa.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11762,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohama-eiwa.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11763,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohama-eiwa.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11764,"name":"ハンドボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohama-eiwa.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11765,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohama-eiwa.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11766,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohama-eiwa.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11767,"name":"ダンス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohama-eiwa.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11768,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohama-eiwa.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11769,"name":"コーラス","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yo